WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,260
This security guard did all this.

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:05,100
This security guard is just an ordinary person

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,700
Just pretending to be a ghost

4
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,360
I'd like to see it

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,160
In front of this three-S ghost that I control

6
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,560
How long can he keep pretending?

7
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:20,690
Say this means

8
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:23,610
There's something wrong with this guy

9
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:24,610
Take action together

10
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:30,280
I really don’t want to cry until I see the official.
